00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:06,000
The Keeping Room is a western, drama film directed by Daniel Barber.

3
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:06,000
In this radically reimagined American Western set towards the end of the Civil War, Southerner Augusta
encounters two renegade, drunken soldiers who are on a mission of pillage and violence.

4
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:06,000
After escaping an attempted assault, Augusta races back to the isolated farmhouse
that she shares with her sister Louise and their female slave Mad.

5
00:25:00,000 --> 00:25:06,000
When the pair of soldiers track Augusta down intent on exacting revenge, the trio of women are forced to take up arms to fend off their assailants,
finding ways to resourcefully defend their home––and themselves––as the escalating attacks become more unpredictable and relentless.

6
