01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The Keeping Room is a 2014 American Western film directed
by Daniel Barber and written by Julia Hart.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The film stars Brit Marling, Hailee Steinfeld, Muna Otaru,
Sam Worthington, Amy Nuttall, and Ned Dennehy.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
It was screened in the Special Presentations section of the
2014 Toronto International Film Festival.

15
01:15:00,000 --> 01:15:06,000
The film was given a limited release in the United States
on September 25, 2015, by Drafthouse Films.

16
01:20:00,000 --> 01:20:06,000
The film was made available on Netflix US on May 4, 2016.

17
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:06,000
The film explores themes of rape, mistaken identity,
murder, home invasion, american civil war.

18
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The tone is emotional.
